        "Tu as des frères et sœurs? = Do you have any brothers and sisters? Je suis fils unique / fille unique / enfant unique = I am an only son / daughter / child.",
        "",
        "## Possessive adjectives",
        "They agree with the noun that follows: **mon** (masculine), **ma** (feminine), **mes** (plural) = my; **ton, ta, tes** = your; **son, sa, ses** = his/her. Before a feminine word starting with a vowel use mon/ton/son: mon amie."
